From 4c59522c85b8485e23572b2f463931c7fa25399e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mminin <mminin2010@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 16:08:52 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] XFA: Draw barcodes

Barcode fields were left empty. Immigration forms print the answers of
the applicant in PDF417 barcodes for data entry, and tax forms use QR
codes.

Barcodes are now encoded with Zint, a new optional dependency
(ENABLE_XFA_BARCODES), and drawn from its module matrix: modules are
moduleWidth wide, PDF417 rows moduleHeight high and as many PDF417
columns are used as fit the field. Linear barcodes show their text
below the bars.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
